COMP5050 Programming Assignment 3 - GPS Tracker Monitor

Student ID: a1957750

Requirements
- JDK 11
- Sodium, Swidget, JUnit 4 and Hamcrest JAR files
- The unmodified course-provided Java files and gps.dat

Setup
Set the following paths before compiling, testing or running:

export PROVIDED_DIR=/path/to/course-provided-files
export SODIUM_JAR=/path/to/sodium.jar
export SWIDGET_JAR=/path/to/swidget.jar
export JUNIT_JAR=/path/to/junit.jar
export HAMCREST_JAR=/path/to/hamcrest-core.jar

Commands
Compile: ./scripts/compile.sh
Test:    ./scripts/test.sh
Run:     ./scripts/run.sh

The run script launches GpsGUI. PROVIDED_DIR must contain gps.dat because the
application reads it from the working directory. Course-provided files and
library JAR files are not included in this repository.

Testing details and test coverage are documented in testing.pdf.